  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal is therefore deemed unlawful",
    "The proposed solar PV equipment would be installed on a flat roof located on a property that is located on article 2(3)&amp;nbsp; land and condition A.2(ba) of Class A, Part 14 of Schedule 2, of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) requires that before beginning development the developer must apply to the local planning authority for a determination as to whether the prior approval of the local planning authority will be required with respect to the impact of the appearance of the solar PV or solar thermal equipment on that land. This has not been undertaken and therefore the proposal fails to meet the requirements set out under Schedule 2, Conditions A.2(ba) and (bb), of Class A of Part 14 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;"
  ],
